    "title": "Beavers finish 11th at The Jewel Invitational - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago LAKE CITY, Minn. – Bemidji State University Women's Golf sophomore Lauren Kamman shot a career-low 164 to lead the Beavers at The Jewel Invitational held at the Jewel Golf Club in Lake City, Minn., Monday-Tuesday. Kammann opened the two-day tournament carding 85 but then fired a career-best 79 in round two as the Beavers finished 11th in the tournament with a team score of 685 (340-345). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
